# Frontend Rules

Technology

- Next.js
- TypeScript
- Tailwind CSS
- shadcn/ui

Prefer functional components.

Avoid class components.

Use strict typing.

Keep components small.

Business logic belongs in hooks or services.

Avoid deeply nested JSX.

Pages should orchestrate.

Components should render.

Never duplicate UI logic.